<title>ITALY: Parmalat Citicorp raise C$150 mln for Ault.</title>
<headline>Parmalat Citicorp raise C$150 mln for Ault.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's largest listed food group Parmalat said on Monday that it and the U.S. bank Citicorp would raise C$150 million in a move to take over Canadian food group Ault Foods Ltd.</p>
<p>It added that the rest of the finance for the C$415 million purchase of Ault Foods announced earlier would come from bank borrowing.</p>
</text>
